# Configuration sync

Feature work is **not** “C only”. Touch every layer that applies:

| Purpose | File / location |
|--------|------------------|
| Sources, include paths, macros | `apps/tuyaos_demo_wukong_ai/local.mk` |
| Application Kconfig selections | `apps/tuyaos_demo_wukong_ai/build/tuya_app.config` |
| Global IoT / audio subsystem options | `T5_TuyaOS-3.13.6/software/TuyaOS/build/tuya_iot.config` |
| Board default snapshots | `apps/tuyaos_demo_wukong_ai/build/appconfig/<BOARD>/` |
| Kconfig symbols & defaults (**file**, not directory) | `apps/tuyaos_demo_wukong_ai/build/APPconfig` |

**Filesystem note:** `build/appconfig/` (directory) vs `build/APPconfig` (file) differs only by case — develop on **Linux or WSL**; avoid case-insensitive volumes.

After changing Kconfig-related inputs, run `make app_config APP_NAME=tuyaos_demo_wukong_ai` from the TuyaOS make root (see `tuyaos-build.mdc`).
